                "letterSpacing" : "normal",
                "lineHeight" : 1.5,
                "textTransform" : "none"
              },
              "text" : "Dear {!$Expression.First_Name} {!$Expression.Last_Name},<br /><br />We hope you are as excited as we are to be part of our Zeta community. <br /><br />Zeta Charter Schools began in 2018 with a dream for what education could make possible for students across New York City. At its heart was a simple idea: <strong>when you build a school around love for students, you build differently. </strong><br /><br /><strong>What does it mean to build a school around love?</strong><br /><br />We often say <strong>Zeta is a love story</strong>. And we mean it. Every student in our schools is deeply known, their dreams are nurtured and they are empowered to become who they are capable of becoming.<br /><br />Love can sound abstract. At <strong>Zeta, it means something solid.</strong> <br /><br /><strong>Love is whole child education:</strong> developing students academically, socially, physically, and emotionally.<br /><br /><strong>Love is safety:</strong> creating an environment where students feel secure, supported, and ready to take ownership of their academics. <br /><br /><strong>Love is knowing every family:</strong> building meaningful partnerships with the people who know our students best.<br /><br /><strong>Love is academic rigor:</strong> believing every student is capable of excellence, challenging them, and giving them the support to reach high standards.<br /><br />"
            },
            "definition" : "lightning/paragraph",
            "id" : "bab774cd-6486-4222-a3dc-f60f55b63aaa",
            "type" : "block"
