                "lineHeight" : 1.5,
                "textTransform" : "none"
              },
              "text" : "<strong>Love is in our Specialties:</strong> giving students opportunities to discover talents and passions through art, music, chess, dance, sports, and more.<br /><br /><strong>Love is in our facilities: </strong>designing spaces that inspire curiosity, creativity, and a love of learning.<br /><br /><strong>Love is welcoming every student</strong> in the city to discover their full potential.<br />"
