              "text" : "Come visit Zeta High: <u><a href=\"https://zetaschools.org/events-for-prospective-families/\" target=\"_blank\" part=\"link\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><font color=\"#0000ff\">sign up for an upcoming event or tour</font></a></u> to learn more about us.<br /><br />We cannot wait to welcome your family to Zeta! <br /><br />Warmly,<br /><strong>The Zeta Enrollment Team</strong><br />Zeta Charter Schools<br />"
